    <string name="heading3">Your privacy is most important</string>
    <string name="desc1">Endless scrolling on reels and shorts can drain your time and focus. Our app helps you break free from the cycle.</string>
    <string name="desc2">Set limits, get reminders, and take back your day. We\'ll help you spend your time more wisely.</string>
    <string name="desc3">Usage and intervention metrics stay on your device. Any session intent you choose to enter is stored locally. We never record screen text or screenshots from other apps, and we do not upload your data.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_more_info">
    Scroll Break uses the Accessibility permission to support Focus Mode, app usage tracking, and optional Smart Scroll Intervention.\n\n
    1. Detecting App Screen – to know which app is currently in use so we can block selected apps when you try to open them.\n
    2. Counting Scrolls – to measure scroll activity and, when enabled, recognize rapid scrolling and a likely stopping point.\n
    3. Local outcomes – when Smart Scroll Intervention is enabled, the app label, session duration, intervention result, and optional intent you enter are stored on this device.\n
    4. Blocking Apps – when Focus Mode is active, the service automatically returns you to the home screen if you try to open a blocked app.\n\n
    🔒 Privacy Assurance:\n
    • We do not read or store screen text, screenshots, or content typed in other apps.\n
    • Optional session intents you enter are stored locally and are never uploaded or shared.\n
    • Usage and intervention data stays on your device.\n
    • The permission is used only on your device, to help you stay focused.
</string>
